tax:governance-types a skos:ConceptScheme ; skos:prefLabel "Governance types"@en-GB ; skos:scopeNote "Normalised from each page's standardization field."@en-GB .
tax:jurisdictions a skos:ConceptScheme ; skos:prefLabel "Regulation Landscape jurisdictions"@en-GB ; skos:scopeNote "Compound source labels are normalised into multiple memberships while the original label is retained on the entry."@en-GB .
